{"id":"n3-058","title":"～というのは","romaji":"〜to iu no wa","jlptLevel":3,"shortExplanation":"Used to provide an explanation or definition; 'that is to say...', 'by that, I mean...'.","longExplanation":"The ～というのは grammar point is used to provide an explanation or definition of the preceding statement or word. It can be translated as 'that is to say...', 'by that, I mean...', or 'what I mean by...'.","formation":"Phrase/sentence + というのは + explanation/definition","examples":[{"jp":"日本に行くというのは、日本に旅行することです。","romaji":"Nihon ni iku to iu no wa, Nihon ni ryokou suru koto desu.","en":"Going to Japan, that is to say, traveling to Japan.","words":[{"surface":"日本","vocabId":"1582710","reading":"にほん"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行く","vocabId":"1578850","reading":"いく"},{"surface":"という","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":"1537250","reading":"の"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"日本","vocabId":"1582710","reading":"にほん"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"旅行","vocabId":"1553170","reading":"りょこう"},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5]},{"jp":"この問題は難しいというのは、解決に時間がかかるということです。","romaji":"Kono mondai wa muzukashii to iu no wa, kaiketsu ni jikan ga kakaru to iu koto desu.","en":"When I say this problem is difficult, I mean it takes time to solve.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"問題","vocabId":"1536010","reading":"もんだい"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"難しい","vocabId":"1460850","reading":"むずかしい"},{"surface":"という","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":"1537250","reading":"の"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"解決","vocabId":"1198960","reading":"かいけつ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"時間","vocabId":"1315920","reading":"じかん"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"かかる","vocabId":"1207590","reading":"かかる"},{"surface":"という","vocabId":null},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5,6]},{"jp":"彼が怒っているというのは、彼が不満を感じているということです。","romaji":"Kare ga okotteiru to iu no wa, kare ga fuman wo kanjiteiru to iu koto desu.","en":"By saying that he's angry, I mean he's feeling dissatisfied.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"怒っ","vocabId":"1445690","reading":"おこる","baseForm":"怒る"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"という","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":"1537250","reading":"の"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"不満","vocabId":"1494970","reading":"ふまん"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"感じ","vocabId":"1212250","reading":"かんじ","baseForm":"感じる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"という","vocabId":null},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6,7]},{"jp":"太るというのは、体重が増えるということです。","romaji":"Futoru to iu no wa, taijuu ga fueru to iu koto desu.","en":"Gaining weight, that is to say, increasing one's body weight.","words":[{"surface":"太る","vocabId":"1408220","reading":"ふとる"},{"surface":"という","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":"1537250","reading":"の"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"体重","vocabId":"1409540","reading":"たいじゅう"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"増える","vocabId":"1602440","reading":"ふえる"},{"surface":"という","vocabId":null},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3]}]}